    {
      "title": "v1.20260716.0",
      "updated": "2026-07-20T02:47:06Z",
      "url": "https://github.com/drawthingsai/draw-things-community/releases/tag/v1.20260716.0",
      "notes_html": "<ul>\n<li>Support Ideogram 4 series models;</li>\n<li>Support Krea 2 series models;</li>\n<li>Support 6-bit S and various other bit S variant format.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>gRPCServerCLI-macOS and draw-things-cli can be directly used on macOS system.</p>\n<p>The container image for this release can be found at <a href=\"https://hub.docker.com/repository/docker/drawthingsai/draw-things-grpc-server-cli\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://hub.docker.com/repository/docker/drawthingsai/draw-things-grpc-server-cli</a></p>",
      "assets": [
