    {
      "title": "v1.20260430.0",
      "updated": "2026-05-01T18:12:44Z",
      "url": "https://github.com/drawthingsai/draw-things-community/releases/tag/v1.20260430.0",
      "notes_html": "<ul>\n<li>Support SeedV2 series models for upscaling.</li>\n<li>Fixed Anima LLM adapter related issues.</li>\n<li>Switched to better and newer causal / mask attention kernels.</li>\n<li>Support running Z Image at BF16 precision.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>gRPCServerCLI-macOS and draw-things-cli can be directly used on macOS system.</p>\n<p>The container image for this release can be found at <a href=\"https://hub.docker.com/repository/docker/drawthingsai/draw-things-grpc-server-cli\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://hub.docker.com/repository/docker/drawthingsai/draw-things-grpc-server-cli</a></p>",
      "assets": [
