      ],
      "assets_source": "https://github.com/drawthingsai/draw-things-community/releases/expanded_assets/v1.20260430.0"
    },
    {
      "title": "v1.20260418.1",
      "updated": "2026-04-20T17:35:13Z",
      "url": "https://github.com/drawthingsai/draw-things-community/releases/tag/v1.20260418.1",
      "notes_html": "<ul>\n<li>Added support for ERNIE Image, including training.</li>\n<li>Added support for Anima Preview 3, including training.</li>\n<li>Fixed crash related to Z-Image LoRA training.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>gRPCServerCLI-macOS and draw-things-cli can be directly used on macOS system.</p>\n<p>The container image for this release can be found at <a href=\"https://hub.docker.com/repository/docker/drawthingsai/draw-things-grpc-server-cli\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://hub.docker.com/repository/docker/drawthingsai/draw-things-grpc-server-cli</a></p>",
