    {
      "title": "v1.20260410.1",
      "updated": "2026-04-11T18:41:23Z",
      "url": "https://github.com/drawthingsai/draw-things-community/releases/tag/v1.20260410.1",
      "notes_html": "<ul>\n<li>Support 8-bit S speed-up on M4 with Apple Neural Engine.</li>\n<li>Support LoRA training of FLUX.2 [klein] 4B / 9B, Z Image, Qwen Image from draw-things-cli.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>gRPCServerCLI-macOS and draw-things-cli can be directly used on macOS system.</p>\n<p>The container image for this release can be found at <a href=\"https://hub.docker.com/repository/docker/drawthingsai/draw-things-grpc-server-cli\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://hub.docker.com/repository/docker/drawthingsai/draw-things-grpc-server-cli</a></p>",
